WEBVTT

00:26.420 --> 00:26.840
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

00:26.420 --> 00:26.840
<b>Medaka!</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

01:23.270 --> 01:29.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:23.270 --> 01:29.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:30.310 --> 01:34.360
<b>Episode 11: Alone with Him</b>

01:30.370 --> 01:35.080
Come one, come all.
We have a special promotion ongoing!

01:35.080 --> 01:37.110
A special promotion? Let's go!

01:37.360 --> 01:38.860
We'll take some.

01:39.610 --> 01:41.660
You two are in luck.

01:41.660 --> 01:46.290
We've got some limited freebies for couples.

01:46.290 --> 01:47.700
Couples...

01:48.400 --> 01:50.180
Are you two together?

01:50.180 --> 01:52.210
U-Uh...

01:52.490 --> 01:56.610
L-Let's just go with it for now, okay?

01:56.610 --> 01:58.950
Huh? O-Okay...

02:00.390 --> 02:02.280
Yes, we are.

02:02.280 --> 02:03.720
Awesome.

02:04.050 --> 02:06.730
Now you just need to prove it.

02:06.730 --> 02:08.350
Prove it?

02:08.350 --> 02:10.480
Kiss for us, here and now.

02:14.390 --> 02:16.190
<i>K-Kiss?</i>

02:17.490 --> 02:18.780
<i>I can't!</i>

02:21.070 --> 02:24.190
<i>N-No, chickenin' out won't help.</i>

02:24.190 --> 02:27.790
<i>Anything Asahi can do, I can do better!</i>

02:28.190 --> 02:30.490
<i>Y-Yeah, just do it!</i>

02:30.490 --> 02:32.740
<i>It's just a kiss. Who cares?</i>

02:33.910 --> 02:35.280
Kuroiwa-kun...

02:43.490 --> 02:45.830
Close your eyes.

02:51.870 --> 02:56.440
<i>A-Are we actually doing this? Seriously?</i>

02:56.760 --> 03:00.070
<i>Do Tokyo folk really kiss so casually?</i>

03:00.890 --> 03:02.990
<i>T-Talk about depraved!</i>

03:03.640 --> 03:05.660
<i>You can do this, girl.</i>

03:07.130 --> 03:11.910
<i>I'm going to have my first kiss 
right here, right now?</i>

03:13.500 --> 03:14.970
<i>You can...</i>

03:21.890 --> 03:24.250
Yeah, I can't do it!

03:25.750 --> 03:29.440
S-Sorry, we're not really a couple.

03:29.440 --> 03:30.730
You don't say.

03:32.130 --> 03:35.180
<i>Almost had it, though?</i>

03:35.180 --> 03:36.700
<i>Wait, no!</i>

03:36.700 --> 03:41.110
<i>I'm a monk in training! 
I can't be wasting time on women!</i>

03:41.110 --> 03:42.320
<i>Focus!</i>

03:42.320 --> 03:44.120
Here ya go.

03:44.120 --> 03:46.380
Thank you.

03:52.370 --> 03:56.220
Kuroiwa-kun's and my treat.

03:56.220 --> 03:57.370
Cheers.

03:57.370 --> 04:00.610
Mona-chan's treat! Thanks!

04:00.610 --> 04:03.620
I'll cherish every bite.

04:03.620 --> 04:05.300
Just eat it.

04:05.300 --> 04:07.570
Way to go, Medaka.

04:07.570 --> 04:09.950
I was just getting a little peckish.

04:09.950 --> 04:12.060
Sure. This is good.

04:12.590 --> 04:14.780
Here you go, you two.

04:14.780 --> 04:16.600
Thank you.

04:16.600 --> 04:19.320
It's all good. Don't be shy.

04:19.320 --> 04:20.650
This is great.

04:21.990 --> 04:23.920
<i>I'm not done yet.</i>

04:23.920 --> 04:25.800
<i>I still have time.</i>

04:26.660 --> 04:29.190
Mona-senpai's good.

04:29.660 --> 04:33.160
While we were distracted by Buggy Bun,

04:33.160 --> 04:36.140
she grabbed herself some 
alone time with Kuroiwa-senpai.

04:36.140 --> 04:39.020
You were the only one distracted.

04:39.020 --> 04:40.970
Keep your foot on the gas, Asahi.

04:40.970 --> 04:42.550
A day out at the theme park?

04:42.550 --> 04:44.130
This is your big chance.

04:44.130 --> 04:45.540
R-Right.

04:48.540 --> 04:51.120
Stay right beside me for the haunted house!

04:51.120 --> 04:53.050
O-Okay, I guess?

04:52.850 --> 04:54.520
<b>Haunted House</b>

04:54.860 --> 04:56.600
Let's ride together!

04:56.600 --> 04:58.580
O-Okay, I guess?

05:00.400 --> 05:01.500
Have one.

05:01.500 --> 05:03.580
O-Okay, I guess?

05:03.240 --> 05:05.110
<b>Takoyaki</b>

05:13.140 --> 05:15.250
She's totally upstagin' ya.

05:15.530 --> 05:19.300
How many times will ya let her move first? 
You gotta have your radar up.

05:19.300 --> 05:23.340
I wanna see you yakkin' it up 
with Kuroiwa-kun more.

05:24.020 --> 05:26.050
What d'you mean, yakkin' it up?

05:26.050 --> 05:30.220
You gettin' discouraged already?
Asahi-chan's gonna take him from you.

05:31.110 --> 05:32.520
Why bring Asahi up?

05:32.520 --> 05:36.600
She's obviously your rival. Why're you 
so meek around your man, anyway?

05:36.600 --> 05:39.360
No! Not this again!

05:39.650 --> 05:41.880
What're you smilin' for?

05:41.880 --> 05:43.950
What, you ask? I mean...

05:43.950 --> 05:44.990
You mean?

05:45.370 --> 05:48.840
Sorry, I just thought it was nice.

05:48.840 --> 05:49.650
Wha?

05:49.650 --> 05:52.910
Think back to how ya used to be.

05:56.220 --> 05:58.690
Rika-chan, I heard you have a crush on Okumura!

05:59.460 --> 06:01.380
Since when? When'd it start?

06:02.520 --> 06:03.570
What started it?

06:03.570 --> 06:04.250
Tell us.

06:04.530 --> 06:08.530
Well, he picked up my eraser for me,

06:08.530 --> 06:11.870
and then he flashed a smile so cool...

06:12.760 --> 06:15.280
How 'bout you, Mona-chan? 
Anyone you have a crush on?

06:15.700 --> 06:17.000
I wanna know!

06:17.000 --> 06:19.520
Me? Not yet, I guess.

06:19.520 --> 06:21.400
What, really?

06:21.400 --> 06:22.860
What kinda boys are you into?

06:23.640 --> 06:25.400
Uh...

06:25.780 --> 06:29.330
Wh-Whoever I fall for, maybe?

06:29.660 --> 06:31.420
Yeah?

06:35.300 --> 06:37.890
I see right through your lies.

06:37.890 --> 06:40.710
You really don't care 
for romance gossip, do ya?

06:41.040 --> 06:41.940
Nope.

06:41.940 --> 06:45.590
Then just say that. Why go along with it?

06:46.530 --> 06:48.490
I don't wanna be disliked.

06:51.800 --> 06:53.960
You're really the 
never-satisfied type, aren'tcha?

06:53.960 --> 06:55.890
Huh? Where'd that come from?

06:56.260 --> 07:00.390
I mean, everyone loves you already, 
but you still want more.

07:00.390 --> 07:02.170
Huh? What?

07:02.170 --> 07:03.500
There's no limit to your greed.

07:03.500 --> 07:05.400
Why're you dissin' me outta nowhere?!

07:05.770 --> 07:07.870
Yet you're not very smooth.

07:08.380 --> 07:12.180
You care so much what people think, 
you end up hidin' who you are.

07:13.660 --> 07:16.910
But I know people'll love ya 
just the way you are.

07:19.960 --> 07:25.380
I was so happy to see you act 
the way you do around Kuroiwa-kun.

07:30.520 --> 07:34.680
I was glad to see you'd found someone 
you could drop your mask around.

07:35.760 --> 07:36.980
Tomo...

07:38.300 --> 07:42.850
Consider givin' him a shot, 
and think it through.

07:43.640 --> 07:50.220
I just don't want you wonderin' 
if you were into him later in life.

07:53.060 --> 07:57.790
Eh, it often tends to be somethin' 
real minor that lights the spark.

07:58.310 --> 08:01.500
Anyway, we should go. 
We're keepin' them waitin'.

08:04.290 --> 08:06.630
You can do this, Mona.

08:18.140 --> 08:20.320
It's starting to get really crowded.

08:20.320 --> 08:22.200
Gotta make sure we don't get separated.

08:22.200 --> 08:23.520
What's next?

08:23.790 --> 08:27.090
Kobayakawa-senpai, I want ice cream.

08:27.090 --> 08:29.930
Yep, me too! Let's go!

08:29.930 --> 08:31.780
Ice cream, here I come!

08:32.730 --> 08:34.350
Go, go, go!

08:33.450 --> 08:36.410
<i>I thought Tomo was just 
havin' fun messin' with me,</i>

08:36.410 --> 08:40.310
<i>but I guess she was really lookin' out for me.</i>

08:40.910 --> 08:43.100
<i>"Just the way I am," though?</i>

08:43.100 --> 08:46.500
<i>Havin' people call me cute has 
practically been my sole purpose in life.</i>

08:46.500 --> 08:48.420
<i>Can I change that now?</i>

08:49.400 --> 08:54.000
<i>What'd she even mean, drop my mask?</i>

08:57.430 --> 09:00.000
<i>When did I let my mask slip?</i>

09:00.000 --> 09:04.810
<i>Did I do something to give her that idea?
That ain't good!</i>

09:04.810 --> 09:07.340
<i>'Cause it means Medaka was there for it!</i>

09:07.340 --> 09:10.730
<i>No... I have no idea what it was!</i>

09:11.730 --> 09:18.570
<i>H-How does Medaka see me, anyway?</i>

09:21.470 --> 09:23.930
<i>Nah, Tomo's got the wrong idea.</i>

09:23.930 --> 09:26.210
<i>Yeah, he doesn't know...</i>

09:26.210 --> 09:27.450
<i>I think.</i>

09:29.080 --> 09:29.880
Huh?

09:32.100 --> 09:33.370
Where's everyone?

09:34.320 --> 09:36.010
Did I make a wrong turn?

09:36.290 --> 09:38.010
I'll ping Tomo.

09:51.220 --> 09:52.940
<i>This sucks.</i>

09:53.300 --> 09:55.860
<i>It's completely dead.</i>

09:55.860 --> 09:58.700
<i>This is why I hate crowds.</i>

09:59.210 --> 10:03.290
<i>Ugh. Guess I gotta wait 
for them to come find me.</i>

10:04.070 --> 10:06.050
Another 10 minutes or so?

10:06.050 --> 10:08.080
I've never ridden this one before.

10:17.480 --> 10:19.720
Damn, girl, you fine.

10:19.720 --> 10:20.970
You here by yourself?

10:26.600 --> 10:28.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

10:31.610 --> 10:33.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

10:39.910 --> 10:42.200
Can't get through to her.

10:42.200 --> 10:44.790
She's not reading her messages, either.

10:45.060 --> 10:46.920
Maybe her battery ran out?

10:46.920 --> 10:52.110
We need to find her quick, or the incoming 
crowd will make it even harder.

10:52.110 --> 10:56.240
L-Let's split up and look for her. 
I'm worried about her.

10:56.240 --> 10:58.030
I'll go that way.

10:58.490 --> 10:59.680
Me too.

11:01.110 --> 11:03.390
Ping once you find her. Got it, Medaka?

11:03.930 --> 11:05.140
Got it.

11:05.470 --> 11:08.340
I'll go check where we ate 
those churros earlier.

11:08.850 --> 11:10.690
I'll go with you.

11:11.390 --> 11:12.310
But...

11:12.310 --> 11:14.640
You can't run holding that.

11:15.820 --> 11:17.250
Later.

11:17.250 --> 11:20.250
First-years, you can focus on eating.

11:20.250 --> 11:22.280
Don't drop your ice cream, now.

11:23.450 --> 11:25.880
If only you hadn't gotten the double, Minami!

11:25.880 --> 11:29.030
You wanted a double scoop too.

11:30.720 --> 11:32.610
What's the problem?

11:32.610 --> 11:34.250
Explore the park with us.

11:34.590 --> 11:36.750
I-I'll pass.

11:37.170 --> 11:39.260
But why? Why?

11:39.540 --> 11:41.380
<i>Gah, take the hint.</i>

11:41.380 --> 11:43.180
C'mon, on your feet.

11:43.180 --> 11:43.760
Hey!

11:44.220 --> 11:45.760
<i>Screw this.</i>

11:45.760 --> 11:47.730
Let me go!

11:47.730 --> 11:50.670
<i>I'm already annoyed about Asahi 
gettin' the upper hand today!</i>

11:50.670 --> 11:51.940
Where we going?

11:51.940 --> 11:53.370
Well...

11:53.370 --> 11:55.170
<i>Then I broke my phone,</i>

11:55.170 --> 11:58.180
<i>and to top it off, I get these idiots 
tryin' to pick me up.</i>

11:58.180 --> 12:02.540
<i>What an awful day. I'm so done.</i>

12:02.540 --> 12:03.340
Hey!

12:08.530 --> 12:10.320
Get away from her.

12:14.200 --> 12:15.830
Who're you?

12:16.350 --> 12:17.460
I...

12:18.410 --> 12:20.460
I'm here with my boyfriend!

12:20.920 --> 12:22.130
Boyfriend?

12:22.130 --> 12:23.470
Who, you?

12:28.990 --> 12:30.640
Tch, let's bounce.

12:30.640 --> 12:31.310
Yeah.

12:33.930 --> 12:36.240
Phew, they're gone.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.100
Hey...

12:40.860 --> 12:42.750
Oh, s-sorry.

12:44.300 --> 12:46.340
<i>That was doubly bad on the nerves.</i>

12:46.750 --> 12:48.580
A-Are you okay?

12:48.950 --> 12:52.330
Y-Yep, thanks.

12:52.760 --> 12:53.660
All good.

12:54.080 --> 12:56.450
<i>My face is burnin'.</i>

12:56.450 --> 12:59.840
<i>Wh-Why am I gettin' so worked up?</i>

12:59.840 --> 13:03.010
<i>Listen, I'm just glad 
he helped me out of trouble.</i>

13:03.550 --> 13:05.380
<i>Calm down, calm down.</i>

13:05.380 --> 13:08.800
<i>I'll be back to myself 
once we're all back together.</i>

13:09.180 --> 13:12.220
S-So, where's everyone?

13:12.220 --> 13:15.560
We split up to look for you. 
Dunno where the others are.

13:15.930 --> 13:19.900
Oh, okay. Could you contact them for me?

13:19.900 --> 13:22.730
I dropped my phone in a fountain.

13:22.730 --> 13:25.740
A fountain? How'd you manage that?

13:40.860 --> 13:44.340
Welp, mine's broken too. 
No way to contact the others.

13:45.340 --> 13:47.040
<i>A-Are you kiddin' me?</i>

13:47.040 --> 13:50.570
<i>We're gonna be all by ourselves 
until the others find us?</i>

13:50.570 --> 13:53.810
<i>My heart's still racin' from before.</i>

13:53.810 --> 13:56.000
<i>This is bad!</i>

13:56.000 --> 13:57.770
L-Let's walk around, I guess?

13:58.710 --> 14:01.060
I mean, we need to find the others.

14:03.270 --> 14:04.440
That okay?

14:04.770 --> 14:06.180
Y-Yeah.

14:06.180 --> 14:10.110
<i>I can walk around with him, no problem.</i>

14:10.110 --> 14:11.700
<i>No problem at all!</i>

14:20.050 --> 14:21.930
S-Sorry about that!

14:21.930 --> 14:23.170
Me too.

14:23.170 --> 14:26.470
Calm and collected... Clear mind, clear spirit.

14:28.200 --> 14:29.710
Wanna go that way?

14:29.710 --> 14:31.600
O-Ogey!

14:33.460 --> 14:37.600
<i>What's with this mood? 
Why am I gettin' so nervous?</i>

14:37.600 --> 14:40.050
<i>What the heck was that "ogey"?!</i>

14:40.050 --> 14:43.580
<i>Where </i>are<i> you guys? I need you all here!</i>

14:52.290 --> 14:54.370
D-Do you wanna get on that?

14:54.370 --> 14:57.540
Huh? N-Not really.

14:59.130 --> 15:00.870
Need to find the others.

15:03.510 --> 15:05.590
<i>He really wants to ride it.</i>

15:06.000 --> 15:10.880
<i>B-But what do I do? If I say yes, 
we'll end up in a tight space together.</i>

15:11.250 --> 15:16.890
<i>But he did come find me, 
losin' his phone in the process.</i>

15:16.890 --> 15:19.890
<i>It's the least I could do after all that.</i>

15:20.730 --> 15:22.820
K-Kuroiwa-kun.

15:22.820 --> 15:24.600
Let's ride the Ferris wheel.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.730
Y-You sure?

15:26.120 --> 15:29.740
We might be able to spot the others 
from above. Come on.

15:30.190 --> 15:32.240
R-Right.

15:32.530 --> 15:36.240
<i>I'll be fine. It'll be over quick, anyway.</i>

15:46.090 --> 15:51.090
<i>What the heck? Is it supposed to be so 
nerve-rackin' just being in here with him?</i>

15:51.430 --> 15:55.180
<i>It's slow as heck, too. 
We're barely off the ground.</i>

15:55.180 --> 15:58.600
<i>Zoom up, zoom down, and let us off already!</i>

16:01.360 --> 16:05.110
Whoa, we're going higher and higher up.

16:06.910 --> 16:11.300
<i>And this guy's just havin' fun.</i>

16:11.300 --> 16:13.800
Hey, we took that ride earlier.

16:13.800 --> 16:17.340
<i>Act a little nervous, damn it!</i>

16:17.340 --> 16:19.160
<i>I mean, nothing wrong with this,</i>

16:19.450 --> 16:22.790
<i>but it makes it look like I'm the 
only one gettin' hot and bothered.</i>

16:25.670 --> 16:28.130
<i>Huh? What's with that look?</i>

16:28.130 --> 16:29.460
<i>Who even was that?</i>

16:29.900 --> 16:33.880
<i>Crap, I had no idea I was doin' that.</i>

16:34.380 --> 16:38.720
<i>I was glad to see you'd found someone 
you could drop your mask around.</i>

16:39.890 --> 16:43.730
<i>Was this what she meant?</i>

16:44.210 --> 16:48.190
<i>Wait a second. 
Have I done this more than once?</i>

16:48.590 --> 16:51.530
No... No!

16:53.610 --> 16:54.900
<i>Like back then...</i>

16:55.170 --> 16:56.870
<i>It's burning a hole in me!</i>

16:57.410 --> 16:59.280
O-Okay, that's that!

16:57.720 --> 16:59.280
<i>And back then...</i>

17:00.030 --> 17:01.370
Lech.

17:03.140 --> 17:04.620
<i>And back then...</i>

17:04.620 --> 17:07.630
Please, wait for me!

17:08.020 --> 17:09.500
<i>And back then,</i>

17:11.730 --> 17:13.090
<i>and back then...</i>

17:14.160 --> 17:15.330
You can't look at it.

17:17.310 --> 17:18.160
Dumbass.

17:20.300 --> 17:21.560
<i>And back then?</i>

17:21.560 --> 17:24.810
Is... Is there anyone you like?

17:25.900 --> 17:27.690
<i>Even back then?!</i>

17:27.690 --> 17:29.520
<i>It can't be!</i>

17:30.940 --> 17:35.550
<i>I've always been the cute, perfect 
version of me in front of people!</i>

17:35.550 --> 17:39.530
<i>So why do I get like this when I'm with him?</i>

17:40.780 --> 17:42.990
I mean, it's my bestie's first love!

17:43.300 --> 17:44.000
<i>N...</i>

17:44.000 --> 17:45.610
<i>No, no way!</i>

17:46.860 --> 17:50.130
Whoa, they're really putting on 
a show down there.

17:50.130 --> 17:52.040
A-A show?

17:52.040 --> 17:54.630
Yeah, I can see it from all the way up here.

17:55.050 --> 17:56.090
Whoa.

17:56.090 --> 17:58.890
<i>Th-That sounds kinda fun.</i>

18:01.640 --> 18:03.230
<i>Wh-Whoa!</i>

18:21.720 --> 18:24.140
<i>Again, who are you?</i>

18:24.940 --> 18:27.180
<i>Is that me?</i>

18:27.180 --> 18:30.460
<i>Really? Why do I look like that?</i>

18:32.920 --> 18:34.960
D-Don't look at me!

18:35.300 --> 18:36.030
Huh?

18:36.030 --> 18:37.170
Just don't!

18:37.170 --> 18:38.590
Wh-What?

18:39.060 --> 18:41.280
<i>Why did I look like that?</i>

18:41.280 --> 18:43.350
<i>It was almost like...</i>

18:43.980 --> 18:47.350
<i>I'm in love or something.</i>

18:47.610 --> 18:48.990
U-Uh...

18:48.990 --> 18:50.280
Don't look at me!

18:50.280 --> 18:53.360
I'm not the least bit cute right now. 
I don't want anyone seeing it.

18:53.700 --> 18:56.520
<i>I'm supposed to be the cutest, 
most perfect being.</i>

18:56.520 --> 18:59.530
<i>I can't let anyone see me like this!</i>

19:01.750 --> 19:05.490
You know, Mona-chan, you kinda...

19:06.500 --> 19:07.750
What?

19:09.150 --> 19:11.610
Uh, well...

19:13.220 --> 19:15.630
Kinda what?

19:17.380 --> 19:21.260
Y-You kinda act weird every now and then.

19:21.730 --> 19:23.760
<i>W-Weird?</i>

19:23.760 --> 19:29.730
You have these moments when you pout 
or look annoyed at something,

19:29.730 --> 19:31.770
but the very next moment you're smiling again.

19:31.770 --> 19:33.720
I can't get a read on you.

19:35.650 --> 19:38.930
<i>No way... Tomo was right!</i>

19:38.930 --> 19:40.900
<i>He saw everything.</i>

19:41.330 --> 19:45.410
<i>Makes sense he'd call me weird 
if he saw all that.</i>

19:45.410 --> 19:47.100
<i>It's all over.</i>

19:47.100 --> 19:51.410
<i>What now? I can't come back from this.</i>

19:57.920 --> 19:59.920
Whoa, hold on!

20:00.380 --> 20:01.670
It's not what you think!

20:04.890 --> 20:08.010
I didn't say that to hurt you.

20:10.410 --> 20:15.380
Sheesh, Sho will yell at me 
for being too tongue-tied again.

20:21.040 --> 20:25.110
You make so many different expressions,

20:26.200 --> 20:27.820
it makes my heart race.

20:29.250 --> 20:32.320
Th-That's why it's a problem for me.

20:33.340 --> 20:36.340
But I also think it makes you...

20:38.130 --> 20:39.860
that much cuter.

20:58.480 --> 21:01.370
I... I'll look over here.

21:01.940 --> 21:05.800
<i>What am I gettin' all charmed for?</i>

21:06.320 --> 21:11.120
<i>It's always like this 
whenever I'm with Medaka.</i>

21:12.020 --> 21:17.710
<i>Others can call me cute or pretty and 
it doesn't affect me one bit, but him?</i>

21:18.270 --> 21:22.980
<i>Wait, no! Again, it's like 
I'm in love or something!</i>

21:23.810 --> 21:28.620
Huh? Is that... Yuzuru and the others? Look!

21:25.940 --> 21:30.190
<i>I'm the one supposed to be charmin' him! 
He has to fall for me!</i>

21:31.000 --> 21:34.550
<i>What I'm feelin' can't be love!</i>

21:35.020 --> 21:36.060
<i>Not a chance...</i>

21:38.580 --> 21:40.020
Thank goodness.

21:41.020 --> 21:42.870
We actually found them.

21:55.670 --> 21:57.940
What? Is something wrong again?

21:57.940 --> 22:00.210
Ah...

22:01.630 --> 22:05.830
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen years old. 
Osaka born and bred.</i>

22:06.530 --> 22:09.040
<i>A girl who charms as easily as she breathes.</i>

22:10.270 --> 22:12.410
<i>A girl who, for the first time in her life...</i>

22:13.660 --> 22:14.970
<i>finds herself in love.</i>

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
<b>Episode 12





First Love with Him</b>

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:46.670 --> 23:49.990
Next time: "First Love with Him."
